    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Prime c.16 Acre Residential Roadside Holding together with 8 Piggery Units\r\n\r\nThis c. 16 acre residential holding is contained in one easily accessed roadside block with a  southerly aspect with views extending to the nearby coastline. The property comprises of a prominently situated 4 bed spacious bungalow style residence with adjacent mainly stone built 2 storey and single storey outbuildings and to the rear of the residence are 8 piggery units. The agricultural lands comprising of c. 15 acres are of an excellent quality suitable for tillage, grazing and silage. These lands have a southerly aspect and have excellent road frontage allowing easy access.  This holding can be sold in one or two lots, these would be: Lot 1. the residence and outbuildings on c.1 acre, and Lot 2. c.15 acres together with the piggery units. This holding is located within a short driving distance of Lislevane village and Barryroe Co Op stores. The renowned market/tourist town of Clonakilty, and the picturesque harbour village of Courtmacsherry are within a short driving distance of the property. This is a very compact and easily managed holding which offers great potential for investment.\r\n\r\nJoint Agents: Irish Rural Homes, Audley Cove, Cappaghglass, Ballydehob, West Cork.\r\n\r\nTel: 00353 28 25935 Email: irishruralhomes@gmail.com"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Residence;\r\nKitchen/Dining Room 4.2m x 5.5m, Reception Room (1) 4.9m x 3.6m, Reception Room (2) 3.9m x 3.7m, Utility Room 6.2 x 3.4, Hallway 3.6m x 3.9m,\r\nBedroom 1. 3.6m x 3.1m, Bedroom 2. 4.0m x 3.6m, Bedroom3. 2.6m x 2.6m, Bedroom 4. 4.5m x 1.8m, Bathroom 1. 1.5m x 2.4m, \r\nBathroom 2. 1.3m x 0.5m, Ensuite 1.2m x 0.7m, W/C 0.9m x 1.4m"
      },
